Auth -[hidden]down- SG
SG -[hidden]down- Base
A6 -[hidden]down- PL
PL -[hidden]down- FDS
CK -[hidden]right- YAML
FDS -[hidden]down- AccA
AccA -[hidden]down- XAcc
A10 -[hidden]right- Dom
VIdx -[hidden]right- Cfg
@enduml
